Source: https://github.com/BondJamesB07/BetterGuac
Comment: BetterGuac is based on Apache Guacamole 1.6.0
 (https://guacamole.apache.org/). The guacd source, the web application and
 the JDBC and TOTP extensions are the Apache Guacamole 1.6.0 releases from
 The Apache Software Foundation, with the BetterGuac changes listed in
 /usr/share/betterguac/legal/NOTICE. Where to get the source of everything
 in this package: /usr/share/betterguac/legal/SOURCES. In short: BetterGuac,
 https://github.com/BondJamesB07/BetterGuac (tag v1.6.0-bg10); Apache
 Guacamole, https://archive.apache.org/dist/guacamole/1.6.0/source/; the
 Java libraries bundled in the web application, unmodified, from Maven
 Central (https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/) as source jars.

